{"id":"dadc51fa9c186f33","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-unfoldable.md","title":"Unfoldable Cardinal","display":"df-unfoldable — Unfoldable Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-unfoldable","aliases":["58-df-unfoldable"],"display":"df-unfoldable — Unfoldable Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-transitive]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-unfoldable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-unfoldable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-unfoldable — Unfoldable Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" href=\"?note=2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" title=\"58-df-transitive\">58-df-transitive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"58-df-elementary-embedding\">58-df-elementary-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KappaModel}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\operatorname{KappaModel}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Model}\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\operatorname{Model}\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Transitive}\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\operatorname{Transitive}\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Unfoldable}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\operatorname{Unfoldable}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (基数)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> (ordinal height)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> (transitive set models)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> (elementary embedding)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KappaModel}_S,\\operatorname{Unfoldable}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{KappaModel}_S,\\operatorname{Unfoldable}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Transitive}\">\\(\\mathrm{Transitive}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (typing predicates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}\\)</span> (ZFC without Power Set)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}model} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{KappaModel}_S(M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\\land\\mathrm{Model}(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\\land\n|M|=\\kappa\\land\\kappa\\in M\\land\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\kappa}M^\\alpha\\subseteq M\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}model} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{KappaModel}_S(M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\\land\\mathrm{Model}(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\\land\n|M|=\\kappa\\land\\kappa\\in M\\land\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\kappa}M^\\alpha\\subseteq M\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unfoldable} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{Unfoldable}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\theta,M\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\theta\\land\\operatorname{KappaModel}_S(M,\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists N,j\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Transitive}(N)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,M,N)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land\\theta&lt;j(\\kappa))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unfoldable} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{Unfoldable}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\theta,M\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\theta\\land\\operatorname{KappaModel}_S(M,\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists N,j\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Transitive}(N)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,M,N)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land\\theta&lt;j(\\kappa))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Unfoldable cardinals embed above every set ordinal.  The quantifier is first-order over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> with an explicit ordinal guard, rather than membership in the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>They are weaker than strongly compact cardinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transitive","status":"resolved","id":"2d9fd66bae7ead5a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-transitive]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","head